---
import GameLayout from "../../../layouts/GameLayout.astro";
---

<GameLayout title="OverTheWire: Bandit Level 16" gameName="bandit" level={16}>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-normal text-neutral-500 mt-6 mb-2">Level Goal</h2>

    <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
        The password for the next level can be retrieved by submitting the
        password of the current level to <strong>port 30001 on localhost</strong
        > using SSL/TLS encryption.
    </p>

    <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4 font-bold">
        Helpful note: Getting "DONE", "RENEGOTIATING" or "KEYUPDATE"? Read the
        "CONNECTED COMMANDS" section in the manpage.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-normal text-neutral-500 mt-6 mb-2">
        Commands you may need to solve this level
    </h2>

    <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
        ssh, telnet, nc, ncat, socat, openssl, s_client, nmap, netstat, ss
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-normal text-neutral-500 mt-6 mb-2">
        Helpful Reading Material
    </h2>

    <ul class="list-disc list-inside pl-4 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        <li>
            <a
                href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transport_Layer_Security"
                class="text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-300 no-underline"
                >Secure Socket Layer/Transport Layer Security on Wikipedia</a>
        </li>
        <li>
            <a
                href="https://www.feistyduck.com/library/openssl-cookbook/online/testing-with-openssl/index.html"
                class="text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-300 no-underline"
                >OpenSSL Cookbook - Testing with OpenSSL</a>
        </li>
    </ul>
</GameLayout>
